.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
data
storage
# The web image is built from the repository root, so without these every
# build would send staged census files and backup archives - secrets
# included - to the builder. Neither is ever copied into an image.
incoming
incoming-prod
backups
# docs/ is NOT ignored: it is the source of the in-app help, which
# scripts/build-help.mjs renders into the frontend bundle during the image
# build. Ignoring it here fails that build rather than shrinking it.
*.md
!README.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
